ResearchTask：
{"task_id": "T-1", "novelty_point_id": "NP-1", "task_type": "literature_search", "language": "en", "description": "针对该查新点执行英文文献检索。", "attempt": 1}

上次失败原因（首次为无）：
无（首次生成）

SearchPlanDraft schema：
{"$defs": {"SearchConceptDraft": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "一个语义概念：角色、规范词项、别名、排除词与重要性。\n\nconcept_id 由系统按顺序分配 C1..Cn；terms 为 3~7 词名词短语（≤3 个），\nalias 为同义/缩写/跨领域叫法（非 paraphrase，≤3 个），\nexclude 为 NOT 词（≤2 个），importance 1~3（3=机制/方法，1=场景/应用）。", "properties": {"role": {"default": "object", "enum": ["object", "method", "feature", "setting", "escape"], "title": "Role", "type": "string"}, "terms": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Terms", "type": "array"}, "alias": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "title": "Alias", "type": "array"}, "exclude": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "title": "Exclude", "type": "array"}, "importance": {"default": 2, "maximum": 3, "minimum": 1, "title": "Importance", "type": "integer"}}, "required": ["terms"], "title": "SearchConceptDraft", "type": "object"}, "SearchStrategyDraft": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "一条检索策略意图；strategy_id 与 expression 由系统生成。\n\nlevel 在 strict/medium/broad 中取值；focus_concepts 可选，引用 C1..Cn，\n非空时覆盖模板的默认概念选择（仅在确有必要时使用）。", "properties": {"level": {"enum": ["strict", "medium", "broad"], "title": "Level", "type": "string"}, "focus_concepts": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "title": "Focus Concepts", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["level"], "title": "SearchStrategyDraft", "type": "object"}}, "additionalProperties": false, "description": "LLM 输出的最小检索计划（v2）。\n\n- concepts 按顺序编号为 C1..Cn；\n- strategies 数量：literature_search 必须恰好三条（strict/medium/broad），\n  补检任务 1~3 条且 level 不重复；\n- 表达式由编译器按模板组装，LLM 不生成布尔表达式。", "properties": {"concepts": {"items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/SearchConceptDraft"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Concepts", "type": "array"}, "strategies": {"items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/SearchStrategyDraft"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Strategies", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["concepts", "strategies"], "title": "SearchPlanDraft", "type": "object"}

